# A FAT whose chain leaves the volume (roadmap os-server.md P9): B:\MANY's
# first cluster points to a reserved value. ls lists the first cluster,
# then stops with an error.
program: sh
media: B damaged
emulators: bochs mame
keys: ls b:/many\n
match: contains
---
/mnt/rx286$ ls b:/many
file01.txt
file30.txt
b:/many: input/output error
/mnt/rx286$
